                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "It\u2019s been over a month since Mike Johnson called for a vote. While families are struggling with the #RepublicanShutdown and bracing for a surge in healthcare costs, Republicans are on vacation. I\u2019m staying in the fight to protect access to affordable, reliable care in the #FightingFifth.",
