                "text": "The #RepublicanShutdown is now putting SNAP benefits at risk for millions. I remain ready and willing to negotiate in good faith to reopen the government, secure affordable healthcare, and make sure plates aren\u2019t ripped from the tables of working families in the #FightingFifth and across the country. Republicans must come to the table and end this #RepublicanShutdown.",
