                "text": "The #RepublicanShutdown is shameful. Republicans are putting lives at risk by refusing to protect access to affordable healthcare. The #FightingFifth deserves better\u2014and I\u2019ll keep fighting to defend the care our communities depend on. https://t.co/dOVgdCmVKV",
