                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Joined @ByronAmos for his District 3 Senior Day Out! The #RepublicanShutdown and Republicans' attacks on Medicaid, Medicare, and SNAP are hurting seniors in the #FightingFifth and across the country. I will never barter on the backs of our seniors \u2014 and I\u2019ll keep fighting to protect their access to affordable healthcare and to keep plates on their tables.",
