                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Three weeks into the #RepublicanShutdown, Mike Johnson still refuses to reconvene the House. In less than 10 days, without Republicans coming to the table, the #FightingFifth will face steep hikes in healthcare premiums. I won\u2019t stop fighting for affordable care. https://t.co/Y3SIpKeaJ3",
