                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "When I'm in D.C., I'm working to reopen the government, lower costs, cancel the cuts, and save healthcare. But because the Trump administration continues to hold SNAP funding hostage, #FightingFifth families need help \u2014 and they need it now.\n\u00a0\nMy team and I spent the day with YMCA of Metro Atlanta serving more than 200 families in need of food on their tables. It's a false choice to have to choose between reopening the government, staying fed, and keeping your healthcare. Americans can \u2014 and should \u2014 have all three.",
